OL,3,GNEWSASwinney to introduce misogyny
OL,4,Aeducation in every school in Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has vowed to introduce
OL,7,Fprogrammes to educate pupils about
OL,8,Fmisogyny in every school in Scotland.
OL,10,FThe first minister said violence
OL,11,Fagainst women and girls was of "such
OL,12,Fseismic significance" that it made the
OL,13,Fmove necessary.
OL,15,FHe has previously described the
OL,16,Fsituation as a "national emergency"
OL,17,Fwith Police Scotland saying more than
OL,18,F200 crimes of violence against women
OL,19,Fand girls are recorded on average every
OL,20,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
