OL,3,GNEWSASwinney to introduce misogyny
OL,4,Aeducation in every school in Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney said Scotland's education
OL,7,Fsystem must be a primary focus to
OL,8,Fchallenge misogynistic behaviour in
OL,9,Fyoung boys - and give young girls "the
OL,10,Fstrength and resilience to say, that's
OL,11,Fnot acceptable".
